@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
skinparam noteBorderColor #B39B4D
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F4F4
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #555555
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #888888
hide footbox
title 一筆 "4"（剩 2 頁）：例外怎麼從 reserve 回到 main 的 catch
participant "PrintQuotaDemo.main\n（for 迴圈內的 try）" as M
participant "Integer" as I
participant "quota : PrintQuota\nremaining = 2" as Q
M -> I : parseInt("4".trim())
I --> M : 4
M -> Q : reserve(4)
activate Q
Q -> Q : 4 < 1 或 4 > 5？ 否
Q -> Q : 4 > remaining(2)？ <b>是</b>
Q -->x M : <b>throw</b> new IllegalArgumentException("剩餘額度不足")
deactivate Q
note right of Q
  remaining -= copies <b>沒有執行</b>
  → 額度仍是 2
end note
note over M
  try 裡「印受理」那一行<b>被跳過</b>
  跳到 catch (IllegalArgumentException e)
  印「拒絕：剩餘額度不足」
  （原因文字由 e.getMessage() 取得）
end note
M -> M : 這次迴圈結束，取下一筆 "2"
@enduml
